'''Mars''' (Japanese: '''マーズ''' ''Mars'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Your opponent shuffles their hand into their deck and draws a card for each of their remaining points needed to win.
}}

