==Trivia==
* {{TCGP|Red Card}} has a less potent version of this card's effect, but as an {{TCGP|Item card}} instead of a {{TCGP|Supporter card}}.
* This card's effect is equivalent to the effect of {{TCG|Reset Stamp}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but as a Supporter card rather than an Item card.
* This card's effect is similar to the effects of the Supporter cards {{TCG|Rocket's Admin.}} and {{TCG|N}} in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but only applies to the opponent instead of both players.
* {{TCG|Mars}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Mars]] is one of the four [[Commander (Trainer class)|Commanders]] of [[Team Galactic]].
*In the standard card's illustration, Mars is seen inside [[Valley Windworks]].

